</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#chamber">Skip to the specimen chamber</a>

  <div class="app" id="appShell">
    <header class="masthead">
      <div class="identity">
        <div class="seal" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.9">
            <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="29.4" opacity=".55"/>
            <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="22.5" stroke-dasharray="1 4" opacity=".55"/>
            <path d="M32 7.8C35.7 21.2 42.8 28.3 56.2 32C42.8 35.7 35.7 42.8 32 56.2C28.3 42.8 21.2 35.7 7.8 32C21.2 28.3 28.3 21.2 32 7.8Z"/>
            <path d="M32 23.5L34.8 29.2L40.5 32L34.8 34.8L32 40.5L29.2 34.8L23.5 32L29.2 29.2L32 23.5Z" opacity=".85"/>
            <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="2.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
            <path d="M32 2.6V7M32 57V61.4M2.6 32H7M57 32H61.4" opacity=".6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Field observatory <span class="sep">·</span> Plate VII <span class="sep">·</span> A closed succession</p>
          <h1 class="title-main">The Nocturnal <em>Vivarium</em></h1>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="deck">A sealed terrarium left to its own inheritance &mdash; nocturne moss, glasswing moths, and ember spiders, observed through the small weathers of thirty-six generations.</p>

      <div class="runhead">
